# purpose: every kind of SUMMARY window, and HISTORY on both ends of a transfer.
# exercises: full / prefix / suffix / mid / from==to / empty / beyond-the-end windows; a window that
#            opens between a transfer's two facts; bad-sequence and bad-range; queries on a frozen
#            account are allowed, on a closed one rejected; count includes non-financial facts.
OPEN a USD
OPEN b USD
OPEN c EUR
DEPOSIT a 100
DEPOSIT b 50
WITHDRAW a 20
TRANSFER a b 30
DEPOSIT c 10
FREEZE a
TRANSFER b a 5
UNFREEZE a
TRANSFER b a 5
WITHDRAW c 10
CLOSE c

HISTORY a
HISTORY b
HISTORY c
HISTORY nobody

SUMMARY a 1 15
SUMMARY a 1 6
SUMMARY a 7 15
SUMMARY a 5 9
SUMMARY a 7 7
SUMMARY a 8 9
SUMMARY a 14 15
SUMMARY a 100 200
SUMMARY b 7 8
SUMMARY b 8 12
SUMMARY c 1 15
SUMMARY nobody 1 2

SUMMARY a x 5
SUMMARY a 5 x
SUMMARY a 9 5
SUMMARY a -1 5
SUMMARY a 1.5 5
SUMMARY a 0 0
SUMMARY a
SUMMARY a 1

FREEZE a
SUMMARY a 1 16
HISTORY a
